## Os cinco verbos {#sec-verbos}

### `@filter` — selecionar linhas

::: {#cell-filter .cell execution_count=1}
``` {.julia .cell-code}
@chain ponds begin
    @filter(richness > 8 && hydro == "permanent")
    nrow
end
```

::: {#filter .cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=1}
```
39
```
:::
:::



Atenção: dentro de `@filter`, use `&&` e `||`, não `&` e `|` como no `dplyr`.

### `@select` — selecionar colunas

::: {#cell-select .cell execution_count=1}
``` {.julia .cell-code}
@chain ponds begin
    @select(pond_id, region, richness)
    first(3)
end
```

